+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use an LRU (Least Recently Used) cache with a 300-second TTL (time-to-live). Entries are evicted by recency of use and also expire after a fixed 300-second window, which was chosen because the combination is easier to reason about and debug than the alternatives.
